# Drafts Directory

This directory is for work-in-progress blog posts and content.

Files in this directory are gitignored and won't be pushed to the public repository,
but they will still be visible when running `hugo server` locally.

To publish a draft:
1. Move the file from `content/drafts/` to the appropriate section (e.g., `content/posts/`)
2. Set `draft: false` in the front matter (or remove the draft line)
3. Commit and push

## Creating a new draft

```bash
# Create a new draft post
hugo new drafts/my-new-post.md
```
